      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page uses the Southern Border region field because the house is first named in the Yi Tian Mountain clash. Unbreakable Iron Fortress is a mobile Immortal Gu House, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
